Add dtiSplit, a CLI for TensorData's external-data split

TensorData.makeExternalData and makeCompactStore are only reachable from the
app's Optimize for Faster Loading action, which is limited to the Metal
performance tiers. Every server load path already opens the store with
externalStore and the .externalData read codec. dtiSplit splits a checkpoint
ahead of first use, and --unsplit reverses it. The tool verifies each file
after writing it, because the upstream helpers swallow their own errors.

Adds an Apps/BUILD target and a Package.swift product and target.
